  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654375/PTI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PTI</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Oct 25, 2026 at 10:04 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: The much-awaited 666-bed <a href=\"/tag/super+speciality+block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">super speciality block</a> at Dr Ram Manohar Lohia (RML) Hospital has secured <a href=\"/tag/fire+safety+clearance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fire safety clearance</a>, removing a key hurdle for commissioning the state-of-the-art facility.With this, the premier Central government hospital moves closer to expanding advanced and affordable healthcare services for thousands of patients from Delhi and neighbouring states.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Built for Rs 482 crore, the 11-storey super speciality block will house 18 operation theatres, 99 ICU beds, 196 high dependency unit beds and three catheterisation laboratories. Once fully operational, the block will increase the hospital's total bed capacity from 1,538 to 2,204, according to officials.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The facility will offer advanced treatment in oncology, oncosurgery, hepatology, gastrointestinal surgery and liver transplantation.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It will also have two linear accelerators for cancer treatment and a nuclear medicine department equipped with PET scan facilities, they said.The clearance arrives as the hospital works to operationalise the new block, which is expected to substantially strengthen specialised and critical care services and cut patient waiting time.The development also coincided with Union Health Minister J P Nadda's review of healthcare services and infrastructure development at the <a href=\"/tag/rml+hospital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RML Hospital</a>. At the meeting, Nadda emphasised strengthening patient-centric healthcare and expanding access to advanced medical facilities at the hospital.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>With the long-awaited clearance now in place, RML Hospital is poised to significantly expand its treatment capabilities and strengthen tertiary healthcare services in the national capital, officials said.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                    \n\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654375/PTI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PTI</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 25, 2026 at 10:04 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 25, 2026 at 10:04 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save you